// Licking County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the OnTrac property search,
// the Board of Elections, The Newark Advocate, the port authority, Pathways and the
// mental health board) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search is OnTrac, run by the county
//     (ontrac.lickingcounty.gov); July's "DDTI" label was wrong.
//   * The ESC is now the Licking Regional Educational Service Center (lresc.org).
//   * Licking Valley Local Schools moved to lvschools.us.
//   * Ohio State Newark and COTC are listed separately (they share a campus).
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the county center's own site.
//   * Johnstown now calls itself a city.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Licking MO; Newark NJ/DE/CA; Heath TX; Granville NY; Hebron KY/CT; Johnstown PA/
//   NY; Alexandria VA; Hanover NH/PA; Utica NY; GROW Licking County links Bowling
//   Green Township to bgohio.gov, which is the City of Bowling Green (Wood County).
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities: Newark (the seat), Heath, Pataskala and Johnstown. Reynoldsburg and New
//     Albany are mainly Franklin County and are left out. Villages with sites:
//     Alexandria, Buckeye Lake, Granville, Hanover, Hartford, Hebron and Utica.
//   * Ten school districts, the Licking Regional ESC and C-TEC; Denison University
//     (Granville), Ohio State Newark and COTC.
//   * Licking Memorial Health Systems; the Licking-Knox mental health board;
//     LEADS Community Action.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * The Village of Kirkersville (not checked in a browser) and the Pataskala
//     library page (stale, unnamed).
//   * Research hit a page-fetch limit; 14 township sites, school building pages,
//     library branches and some city safety pages were not fetched.
//   * Vendor portals: CourtView, Recorder records, sheriff sales.

